11
00:00:32.794 --> 00:00:35.869
So if you can answer every case question in writing,

12
00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.233
you've covered the closed questions too.

13
00:00:38.683 --> 00:00:40.979
Ten cases, in booklet order.

14
00:00:40.979 --> 00:00:43.193
Case 2, lymph node removal.

15
00:00:43.193 --> 00:00:44.423
Case 3, asthma.

16
00:00:44.423 --> 00:00:46.227
Case 4, panic attacks.

17
00:00:46.227 --> 00:00:47.621
Case 6, diabetes.

18
00:00:47.621 --> 00:00:49.998
Case 8, joints and arthritis.

19
00:00:49.998 --> 00:00:53.442
Case 9, neurotransmitters and Parkinson's.

20
